+# Caveman cover after emergency prayer
+
+After recovering from critical HP on a previously held square, a Caveman still
+beside a crowd can take one cover action against foes that fear Elbereth. The
+existing hold logic resumes after a short window.
+
 # zLeadersSeed812011 (Claude, 2026-10-26)
 
 Identity router. Default base/ = github.com/daglar-dragomirov/nethacker@eab9a9c4f4e09bce096d5762e895fec51b63784d (unmodified).
